# Quiz lifecycle statuses

Canonical `QuizLifecycleStatus` IDs:

| ID | Status | Meaning |
|----|--------|---------|
| **60** | **Draft** | Initial; only **owner** and **PortalAdmin** can see |
| **61** | **Published** | Visible by school/campus/portal rules; **Public** audience → everyone can view & assign |
| **62** | **Assigned** | Has assignment rows; assigned students can take it |
| **63** | **Archived** | Soft-archive when assignments exist; otherwise hard-delete |

Do **not** use Completed, In Progress, or Cancelled as quiz lifecycle statuses (retired lookups 64/65/66).

## Visibility

- **PortalAdmin**: all quizzes including drafts
- **SchoolAdmin**: own school (all campuses) + Public; not other teachers' drafts
- **CampusAdmin**: own campus + Public; not other teachers' drafts
- **Teacher**: own quizzes + Public catalog
- **Student**: assigned quizzes + open Public window

## Archive / cancel

- Archive with **no assignments** → hard delete
- Archive with assignments → lifecycle Archived (`IsActive=false`)
- Cancel upcoming assignments → restore **Assigned** or **Published** (never Cancelled)
